Installing program.

1: Disable WiFi power management
  sudo /sbin/iwconfig wlan0 power off
  add to /etc/rc.local ???

2: Clone flaschen-taschen
  git clone --recursive https://github.com/hzeller/flaschen-taschen.git

3: Build and install ft-server:
  cd flaschen-taschen/server 
  make FT_BACKEND=rgb-matrix
  cp ft-server /usr/local/bin

4: Install and start the flaschen taschen service
  cp ft-server.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/
  [ ln -s /usr/lib/systemd/system/ft-server.service /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/ ]
  systemctl enable ft-server.service
  systemctl start ft-server.service

5: Clone and install LMSDisplay.   Note, if you get errors about "externally managed environment", add the "--break-system-packages"
  git clone REPOSITORY/LMSDisplay
  cd LMSDisplay
  sudo pip install . [--break-system-packages]

6: Install and start the LMSDisplay services
  cp lmsdisplay.service lmsdisplaycontrol.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/
  [ ln -s /usr/lib/systemd/system/{lmsdisplay,lmsdisplaycontrol}.service /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/ ]
  systemctl enable lmsdisplay.service lmsdisplaycontrol.service
  systemctl start lmsdisplay.service lmsdisplaycontrol.service

5: Configure the display.
  Use a browser to connect to http://[DISPLAYMACHINE]:5000
  Set, at a minimum, the LMS Server and Player you wish to monitor.
